SUMMARY:Historic Manassas Holiday Market
DESCRIPTION:  \n \nWelcome to our annual Holiday Market which takes place during our Merry Old Town event. Join our holiday vendors in the train depot lot as they bring you their artisan wares just in time for the holidays. These make for amazing gifts for all of your friends and loved ones!
URL:https://historicmanassas.org/event/historic-manassas-holiday-market/
LOCATION:Historic Downtown Manassas @ 9431 West St\, Manassas\, VA 20110\, USA\, Manassas\, VA\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts,Featured,Festival,Parade,Winter Holiday
