SUMMARY:The Adventures Of Harold And The Purple Crayon - Manassas
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a whimsical journey at "The Adventures Of Harold And The Purple Crayon - Manassas\," where imagination knows no bounds! This delightful performance will take place at the charming Merchant Hall At Hylton Performing Arts Center\, a venue known for its warm atmosphere and family-friendly vibe. Watch as Harold brings his colorful world to life\, inspiring creativity and laughter in audiences of all ages. \nGather your loved ones for an unforgettable experience filled with enchanting storytelling and vibrant visuals. This is the perfect opportunity to introduce your little ones to the magic of live theatre in a cozy setting. Don’t miss out on this captivating adventure—book your tickets today and let your imagination soar!
URL:https://historicmanassas.org/event/the-adventures-of-harold-and-the-purple-crayon-manassas/
LOCATION:Merchant Hall At Hylton Performing Arts Center\, 10960 GEORGE MASON CIR\, Manassas\, VA\, 20110\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://historicmanassas.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/The-Adventures-Of-Harold-And-The-Purple-Crayon.jpg
END:VEVENT
